Find an altar, hopefully you have a way to get a pudding onto that level. 
Kicking sinks, figurines, etc. Kick a sink until you get a black pudding. 
Wield a crappy metal weapon, orcish dagger, and start hitting the puddings. 
The black pudding will split in two. Heal up the pudding you struck and 
strike it again. Keep going until you have many puddings. Lure them to the 
altar, kill them, sac them, receive gifts from your deity. Also eat the 
corpses to gain intrinsics.

